---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import mainLogo from '../assets/Rectangle Logo SVG transparent.svg';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>45-Minute Media</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg-color: #FFFFFF;
        --text-color: #1A1A1A;
        --border-color: #E5E7EB;
        --accent-blue: #0056b3;
      }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: var(--bg-color);
        color: var(--text-color);
        line-height: 1.6;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        min-height: 100vh;
      }
      
      /* Header & Nav */
      header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      }
      .logo-container img { height: 35px; width: auto; }
      nav { display: flex; gap: 2rem; }
      nav a { text-decoration: none; color: #6B7280; font-size: 0.95rem; transition: color 0.2s; }
      nav a:hover, nav a.active { color: var(--text-color); font-weight: 500; }

      /* Main Content (Documentation Style) */
      main { flex: 1; width: 100%; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 4rem 2rem; }
      h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
      h2 { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 500; margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem 0; }
      p { font-size: 1.05rem; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
      
      /* Ordered Lists like the Setup Guide */
      ol { margin-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; color: #374151; }
      ol li { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; padding-left: 0.5rem; }

      /* Terminal Block */
      .terminal-block {
        background-color: #111827;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        margin: 2rem 0;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }
      .terminal-header {
        background-color: #1F2937;
        padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: #9CA3AF;
        font-family: monospace;
      }
      .terminal-body { padding: 1.5rem; color: #E5E7EB; font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.9rem; }
      .terminal-prompt { color: #10B981; margin-right: 0.5rem; }

      footer {
        text-align: center; padding: 2rem; font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: #9CA3AF; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    
    <header>
      <div class="logo-container">
        <a href="/"><Image src={mainLogo} alt="45-Minute Media Logo" /></a>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="/" class="active">Home</a>
        <a href="/work">Work</a>
        <a href="/contact">Get Started</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <h1>Video production for brands who'd rather be running their business.</h1>
      <p>We've engineered a streamlined process that removes the friction from creating professional video content. No endless pre-production meetings, no confusing revisions.</p>

      <h2>Step 1: Navigate the Setup Prompts</h2>
      <p>When the setup wizard starts, pay close attention to the very first prompt:</p>
      
      <ol>
        <li><strong>What is your objective?</strong> If it suggests something complicated, press the backspace key to delete that text, and define your core message.</li>
        <li><strong>Select your format:</strong> Choose between Brand Storytelling, Executive Messaging, or Social Campaigns.</li>
        <li><strong>Install dependencies?</strong> Yes. We handle lighting, audio, and logistics.</li>
      </ol>

      <div class="terminal-block">
        <div class="terminal-header">
          <span>Bash</span>
          <span>&#9660; &#9744;</span>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-body">
          <span class="terminal-prompt">$</span> npm install 45-minute-media@latest<br><br>
          <span style="color: #60A5FA;">Launch sequence initiated.</span><br>
          > Compiling story assets...<br>
          > Optimizing for audience engagement...<br>
          > Production ready.
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p>&copy; 2026 45-Minute Media. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>